    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.poster.avif?t=1748968245\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.webm?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.mp4?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone gave the goblins firearms and now we are screwed. Fortunately, you have access to the latest in Witch technology with magic, boom sticks, new brooms and spirit animals to choose from. With 10 000 combinations, you'll be sure to teach those goblins what for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broomtastic Combat</strong> : Your mission is to hang on until the timer runs out and defeat the goblin king. Hold on tight as you zip around the forest on your broom,\u00a0 blasting at your foes with magic and gunpowder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multiplicity of Magical Mischief :\u00a0</strong>the goblins have upped their game and so must we, its time to modernize with brooms, robot vacuums, hoovers and more. Don't worry about your wand, we have fitted it inside of your fire arm, so you can cast spells and blast those goblins away with your boom stick at the same time. And don't forget your spirit animal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic achievements :\u00a0</strong>\u00a0The wizard school blew up, but that doesn't mean you can slack of with your studies. Earn the respect of your peers with several achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now my witch, go forth, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cackle for Love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cackle for Life,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CACKLE FOR VICTORY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.poster.avif?t=1748968245\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.webm?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.mp4?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.poster.avif?t=1748968245\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.webm?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/319719fd3f8859e74c008e5b662d7cab.mp4?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone gave the goblins firearms and now we are screwed. Fortunately, you have access to the latest in Witch technology with magic, boom sticks, new brooms and spirit animals to choose from. With 10 000 combinations, you'll be sure to teach those goblins what for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broomtastic Combat</strong> : Your mission is to hang on until the timer runs out and defeat the goblin king. Hold on tight as you zip around the forest on your broom,\u00a0 blasting at your foes with magic and gunpowder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multiplicity of Magical Mischief :\u00a0</strong>the goblins have upped their game and so must we, its time to modernize with brooms, robot vacuums, hoovers and more. Don't worry about your wand, we have fitted it inside of your fire arm, so you can cast spells and blast those goblins away with your boom stick at the same time. And don't forget your spirit animal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic achievements :\u00a0</strong>\u00a0The wizard school blew up, but that doesn't mean you can slack of with your studies. Earn the respect of your peers with several achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now my witch, go forth, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cackle for Love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cackle for Life,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CACKLE FOR VICTORY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.poster.avif?t=1748968245\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.webm?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673790/extras/df0daecbb4d2636e3e8296e74107dfd7.mp4?t=1748968245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Blast goblins with gunpowder and magic as you ride your assortment of broom and broom-like apparatuses in this twin stick arcade shooter. Customize your witch and cackle for Victory!",
